            "pure-rule; static void ensureValidSize(int size) accepts only odd sizes >= 21; static int capacityBits(int size) derives capacity by counting false entries in FinderPattern.reservedMask(size) and may round down to a multiple of 8; avoids double-counting or heuristic subtraction."
        ],
        [
